fied","source":"none","fetched_at":"2026-09-12T00:31:15Z","response_hash":"","fields":{"author":"{D. Williams et al.}","title":"High Efficiency Harmonic Injection Power Amplifier","day":"15","month":"December","year":"1991","nationality":"United States","number":"5,172,072"},"diffs":[],"failure_note":"not found at the registries — books published before DOIs often are not registered; the entry may still be correct"},{"kind":"bib-entry","target":"bandlimited_radar_signals","verdict":"unverified","source":"none","fetched_at":"2026-09-12T00:31:15Z","response_hash":"","fields":{"author":"Chen, R. and Cantrell, B.","booktitle":"Radar Conference, 2002. Proceedings of the IEEE","title":"Highly bandlimited radar signals","year":"2002","month":"","volume":"","number":"","pages":"220 - 226","keywords":"45 MHz; Barker code; Gaussian-windowed sinc functions; amplifier configuration; autocorrelation functions; bandlimited radar signals; continuous-time signals; discrete-time signals; linear amplification using nonlinear components; modulation technique; spectrally clean signals; amplification; bandlimited signals; codes; continuous time systems; digital-analogue conversion; discrete time systems; modulation; radar signal processing; signal generators;","doi":"10.1109/NRC.2002.999722","issn":"1097-5659"},"diffs":[],"failure_note":"not found at the registries — books published before DOIs often are not registered; the entry may still be correct"},{"kind":"bib-entry","target":"barton","verdict":"verified","source":"crossref-query","fetched_at":"2026-09-12T00:31:15Z","response_hash":"eb47a74b182b9e2e","fields":{"author":"D. Barton","title":"Radar System Analysis and Modeling","publisher":"Artech House","year":"2005","address":"685 Canton St. Norwood, MA 02062","edition":"2nd","month":"Nov","note":""},"diffs":[]},{"kind":"bib-entry","target":"basic_load_pull","verdict":"verified","source":"crossref-query","fetched_at":"2026-09-12T00:31:15Z","response_hash":"360e622ad3099e33","fields":{"author":"Cusack, J.M. and Perlow, S.M. and Perlman, B.S.","journal":"Microwave Theory and Techniques, IEEE Transactions on","title":"Automatic Load Contour Mapping for Microwave Power Transistors","year":"1974","month":"dec","volume":"22","number":"12","pages":"1146 - 1152","keywords":"","doi":"","issn":"0018-9480"},"diffs":[]},{"kind":"bib-entry","target":"baziotis-etal-2020-language","verdict":"unverified","source":"none","fetched_at":"2026-09-12T00:31:15Z","response_hash":"","fields":{"title":"Language Model Prior for Low-Resource Neural Machine Translation","author":"Baziotis, Christos  and\n      Haddow, Barry  and\n      Birch, Alexandra","booktitle":"Proceedings of the 2020 Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (EMNLP)","month":"nov","year":"2020","address":"Online","publisher":"Association for Computational Linguistics","url":"https://aclanthology.org/2020.emnlp-main.615","doi":"10.18653/v1/2020.emnlp-main.615","pages":"7622--7634","abstract":"The scarcity of large parallel corpora is an important obstacle for neural machine translation. A common solution is to exploit the knowledge of language models (LM) trained on abundant monolingual data. In this work, we propose a novel approach to incorporate a LM as prior in a neural translation model (TM). Specifically, we add a regularization term, which pushes the output distributions of the TM to be probable under the LM prior, while avoiding wrong predictions when the TM {``}disagrees{''} with the LM. This objective relates to knowledge distillation, where the LM can be viewed as teaching the TM about the target language. The proposed approach does not compromise decoding speed, because the LM is used only at training time, unlike previous work that requires it during inference. We present an analysis of the effects that different methods have on the distributions of the TM. Results on two low-resource machine translation datasets show clear improvements even with limited monolingual data."},"diffs":[],"failure_note":"not found at the registries — books published before DOIs often are not registered; the entry may still be correct"},{"kind":"bib-entry","target":"benedikt00_active_nFlp","verdict":"unverified","source":"none","fetched_at":"2026-09-12T00:31:15Z","response_hash":"","fields":{"author":"Benedikt, J. and Gaddi, R. and Tasker, P.J. and Goss, M.,","journal":"Microwave Theory and Techniques, IEEE Transactions on","title":"High-power time-domain measurement system with active harmonic load-pull for high-efficiency base-station amplifier design","year":"2000","month":"Dec","volume":"48","number":"12","pages":"2617 -2624","keywords":"30 W;30-W power level;4 W;4-W LDMOS;4.7 W;active harmonic load-pull;base-station amplifier design;efficiency;gain;harmonic load-pull;high-power time-domain measurement;linear capacitance effects;mobile communication;power amplifier;real-time measurement;vector correction;waveform analysis;waveform measurement;calibration;harmonic analysis;microwave measurement;microwave power amplifiers;mobile radio;power MOSFET;waveform analysis;","doi":"10.1109/22.899021","issn":"0018-9480"},"diffs":[],"failure_note":"not found at the registries — books published before DOIs often are not registered; the entry may still be correct"},{"kind":"bib-entry","target":"bojar-etal-2014-hindencorp","verdict":"verified","source":"crossref-query","fetched_at":"2026-09-12T00:31:15Z","response_hash":"bb3a97a37ce64b5c","fields":{"title":"{H}ind{E}n{C}orp - {H}indi-{E}nglish and {H}indi-only Corpus for Machine Translation","author":"Bojar, Ond{\\v{r}}ej  and\n      Diatka, Vojt{\\v{e}}ch  and\n      Rychl{\\'y}, Pavel  and\n      Stra{\\v{n}}{\\'a}k, Pavel  and\n      Suchomel, V{\\'\\i}t  and\n      Tamchyna, Ale{\\v{s}}  and\n      Zeman, Daniel","booktitle":"Proceedings of the Ninth International Conference on Language Resources and Evaluation ({LREC}'14)","month":"may","year":"2014","address":"Reykjavik, Iceland","publisher":"European Language Resources Association (ELRA)","url":"http://www.lrec-conf.org/proceedings/lrec2014/pdf/835_Paper.pdf","pages":"3550--3555","abstract":"We present HindEnCorp, a parallel corpus of Hindi and English, and HindMonoCorp, a monolingual corpus of Hindi in their release version 0.5. Both corpora were collected from web sources and preprocessed primarily for the training of statistical machine translation systems. HindEnCorp consists of 274k parallel sentences (3.9 million Hindi and 3.8 million English tokens). HindMonoCorp amounts to 787 million tokens in 44 million sentences. Both the corpora are freely available for non-commercial research and their preliminary release has been used by numerous participants of the WMT 2014 shared translation task."},"diffs":[]},{"kind":"bib-entry","target":"brown","verdict":"unverified","source":"none","fetched_at":"2026-09-12T00:31:15Z","response_hash":"","fields":{"author":"Brown, W.C.","journal":"Microwave Theory and Tech., IEEE Trans. on","title":"The History of Power Transmission by Radio Waves","year":"1984","month":"sep","volume":"32","number":"9","pages":"1230 - 1242","keywords":"","doi":"10.1109/TMTT.1984.1132833","issn":"0018-9480"},"diffs":[],"failure_note":"not found at the registries — books published before DOIs often are not registered; the entry may still be correct"},{"kind":"bib-entry","target":"brown1988statistical","verdict":"verified","source":"crossref-query","fetched_at":"2026-09-12T00:31:15Z","response_hash":"3d78f91bc4988cef","fields":{"title":"A statistical approach to language translation","author":"Brown, Peter F and Cocke, John and Della Pietra, Stephen A and Della Pietra, Vincent J and Jelinek, Frederick and Mercer, Robert L and Roossin, Paul","booktitle":"Coling Budapest 1988 Volume 1: International Conference on Computational Linguistics","year":"1988"},"diffs":[]},{"kind":"bib-entry","target":"brown1_1970","verdict":"unverified","source":"none","fetched_at":"2026-09-12T00:31:15Z","response_hash":"",