rce NLP is to quickly and accurately reproduce the results of new work, in a manner that the community can easily use and modify. While most papers publish enough detail for replication, it still may be difficult to achieve good results in practice. This paper presents a worked exercise of paper reproduction with the goal of implementing the results of the recent Transformer model. The replication exercise aims at simple code structure that follows closely with the original work, while achieving an efficient usable system."},"diffs":[]},{"kind":"bib-entry","target":"schmelzer07_classF80PAE","verdict":"mismatch","source":"openalex","fetched_at":"2026-09-12T00:31:15Z","response_hash":"71048ef8545afca1","fields":{"author":"Schmelzer, D. and Long, S.I.","journal":"Solid-State Circuits, IEEE Journal of","title":"A {GaN HEMT class F} Amplifier at 2 {GHz} With greater than 80\\% {PAE}","year":"2007","month":"Oct.","volume":"42","number":"10","pages":"2130 -2136","keywords":"GaN - Interface;GaN HEMT transistor;HEMT class F amplifier;hybrid printed circuit board;peak power-added efficiency;power 16.5 W;amplifiers;high electron mobility transistors;printed circuits;wide band gap semiconductors;","doi":"10.1109/JSSC.2007.904317","issn":"0018-9200"},"diffs":[{"field":"title","in_document":"A {GaN HEMT class F} Amplifier at 2 {GHz} With greater than 80\\% {PAE}","in_source":"A GaN HEMT Class F Amplifier at 2 GHz With $>\\,$80% PAE","severity":"medium"}]},{"kind":"bib-entry","target":"search_method","verdict":"verified","source":"openalex","fetched_at":"2026-09-12T00:31:15Z","response_hash":"71048ef8545afca1","fields":{"author":"Jeffrey C. Lagarias and James A. Reeds and Margaret H. Wright and Paul E. Wright","collaboration":"","title":"Convergence Properties of the Nelder--Mead Simplex Method in Low Dimensions","publisher":"SIAM","year":"1998","journal":"SIAM Journal on Optimization","volume":"9","number":"1","pages":"112-147","keywords":"direct search methods; Nelder--Mead simp